        "original_id": "cb5ec61a-a46c-5a50-8636-198b87f34d01",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lance Franklin\n- Awards: 2013 AFL Goal of the Year, All-Australian selections, Coleman Medals\n- Events: final public vote after the home-and-away season\n\nFacts:\n- At the end of the 2013 AFL home-and-away season, three finalists were selected for a final public vote for the 2013 AFL Goal of the Year.\n- Lance Franklin won the final public vote for the 2013 AFL Goal of the Year with a long-range goal after hurdling over a teammate in the middle of the ground.\n- Lance Franklin has won seven All-Australian selections during his career, including three at full forward and four at centre half-forward.\n- Lance Franklin has won four Coleman Medals during his career.",
